{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "mgxupg9107trcq3t", "title": "索引的分类", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"zn3dJ\" id=\"zn3dJ\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0d6ed84\" id=\"uc0d6ed84\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">主键索引（Primary Key Index）：</span></h2><ul list=\"uf4a9abce\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u8db99cd9\" data-lake-id=\"u1039e665\" id=\"u1039e665\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b68e232\" id=\"u7b68e232\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">主键索引是唯一且特殊的索引，用于唯一标识表中的每一行。创建主键时，MySQL会自动创建一个唯一索引。</span></li><li fid=\"u8db99cd9\" data-lake-id=\"uff41d970\" id=\"uff41d970\"><span data-lake-id=\"u910c301c\" id=\"u910c301c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">主键索引不允许有NULL值，并且表中每一行的主键值必须是唯一的。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u6cb50c7b\" id=\"u6cb50c7b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F26817902%2F1727088153044-b1efc41f-7561-4ed7-a779-78541422dd7a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubd8bf437-24cd-43da-a261-8e44a86797b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u35a910bc-1e33-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1262%2C%22height%22%3A620%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A53011%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A643%2C%22originHeight%22%3A316%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRIMARY%22%2C%22x%22%3A337%2C%22y%22%3A1%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A441%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ERIC%22%2C%22x%22%3A262%