">普通索引（Regular Index）：</span></h2><ul list=\"ud95adbf9\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ucebff689\" data-lake-id=\"ua9e28440\" id=\"ua9e28440\"><span data-lake-id=\"u500c1774\" id=\"u500c1774\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">普通索引是最基本的索引类型，不强制唯一性。它们可以加快查询速度，但对插入、更新性能有一定影响。</span></li><li fid=\"ucebff689\" data-lake-id=\"u315a4c86\" id=\"u315a4c86\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6596329\" id=\"uf6596329\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">可以在一个表上创建多个普通索引。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u9332c7c5\" id=\"u9332c7c5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F26817902%2F1727088207247-e64ec4f3-f07e-4ea5-b901-12a9e3b9c7c6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u88a71fef-596f-4da9-aba8-17a22c9ee4e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u35a910bc-1e33-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1302%2C%22height%22%3A597%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A60199%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A694%2C%22originHeight%22%3A318%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22SECONDARYKEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A348%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A405%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A376%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A323%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BOB%22%2C%22x%22%3A88%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOM%22%2C%22x%22%3A472%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A246%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3