ac4\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"uff27d0de\" id=\"uff27d0de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">在执行涉及多个列的查询时，复合索引能显著提高查询效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ude702474\" id=\"ude702474\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F26817902%2F1727088234038-1fda88cf-b51f-4928-8e19-ea0fb18adedb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0bc1c0e3-6860-4231-b56a-680a8b34614%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u35a910bc-1e33-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1313.71875%2C%22height%22%3A457%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A122246%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1159%2C%22originHeight%22%3A403%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEYIDXNAMEAGEPOSITION(NAME%2CAGE%2CPOSITION)USINGBTREE%22%2C%22x%22%3A180%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A679%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222001-08-03%22%2C%22x%22%3A173%2C%22y%22%3A343%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222006-03-06%22%2C%22x%22%3A313%2C%22y%22%3A343%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HANMEIME%22%2C%22x%22%3A523%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222002-06-03%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222011-08-07%22%2C%22x%22%3A874%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HANMEIMEI%22%2C%22x%22%3A478%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MANAGER%22%2C%22x%22%3A1027%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222009-01-06%22%2C%22x%22%3A663%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222008-07-06%22%2C%22x%22%3A523%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A1