%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JEFF%22%2C%22x%22%3A697%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2230%22%2C%22x%22%3A78%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2231%22%2C%22x%22%3A208%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2230%22%2C%22x%22%3A1042%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2222%22%2C%22x%22%3A700%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BILL%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A267%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2230%22%2C%22x%22%3A904%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2232%22%2C%22x%22%3A349%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23272826%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ucd465313%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"BRb9I\" id=\"BRb9I\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud7ef4940\" id=\"ud7ef4940\">总结</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1eead9b2\" id=\"u1eead9b2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad664f2a\" id=\"uad664f2a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">对于如何选择和使用索引，以下几点建议可能对你有帮助：</span></p><ul list=\"u82974579\"><li fid=\"u78a7ee5e\" data-lake-id=\"u4d61e0d8\" id=\"u4d61e0d8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc3b5d508\" id=\"uc3b5d508\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">根据查询模式选择索引列</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7dc5e198\" id=\"u7dc5e198\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">：如果某列频繁出现在</span><span data-lake-id=\"u76ea30db\" id=\"u76ea30db\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--nb-color-white) / var(--tw-text-opacity))\">WHERE</span><span data-lake-id=\"uccaf7b1f\" id=\"uccaf7b1f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">子句、</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8b1a5f82\" id=\"u8b1a5f82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--nb-color-white) / var(--tw-text-opacity))\">JOIN</span><span data-lake-id=\"u32d79bf6\" id=\"u32d79bf6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">条件或者</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3f7f5e28\" id=\"u3f7f5e28\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--nb-color-white) / var(--tw-text-opacity))\">ORDER BY</span><span data-lake-id=\"uc2c14783\" id=\"uc2c14783\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">子句中，应考虑在该列上建立索引。</span></li><li fid=\"u78a7ee5e\" data-lake-id=\"u7347930e\" id=\"u7347930e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0972a2f5\" id=\"u0972a2f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">限制索引数量</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u21c10c2a\" id=\"u21c10c2a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">：虽然索引可以加快查询速度，但过多的索引会影响插入和更新操作性能，因此应平衡索引数量和写操作性能。</span></li><li fid=\"u78a7ee5e\" data-lake-id=\"uec62b873\" id=\"uec62b873\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub29df511\" id=\"ub29df511\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">利用复合索引</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u89e0ab48\" id=\"u89e0ab48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">：对涉及多个列的查询，可以考虑创建复合索引，但要注意复合索引的列顺序，应根据查询频率和查询类型来决定。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u46ba5efc\" id=\"u46ba5efc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u512076d9\" id=\"u512076d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">希望这些信息能帮助到你在MySQL数据库管理中的索引设计</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 506, "description": "1. 主键索引（Primary Key Index）：主键索引是唯一且特殊的索引，用于唯一标识表中的每一行。创建主键时，MySQL会自动创建一个唯一索引。主键索引不允许有NULL值，并且表中每一行的主键值必须是唯一的。2. 唯一索引（Unique Index）：唯一索引确保列中的所有值都是唯一...", "updated_at": "2025-08-09T07:08:56.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:01.000Z", "id": 216261319, "status": 1}